@ToDo_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### GET
GET {{ToDo_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### GET todo by ID
GET {{ToDo_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### POST
POST {{ToDo_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bake bread"
}

### PUT
PUT {{ToDo_HostAddress}}/api/todos/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{ToDo_HostAddress}}/api/todos/5